<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 122 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 122 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, trailing West Indies by 36 runs on first innings, were all out for 122 at tea on the third day of the third test at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 219 (Greg Blewett 62, Curtly Ambrose five for 55) and 122 all out; West Indies 255 all out (Jimmy Adams 74 not out, Glenn McGrath five for 50).</p>
